# A BUILD over the ray limit TRACES without the linear model, as its message says (cmdref: Linear model; Export).
# Before, 'Tracing N rays but not BUILDing linear model' was followed by nothing (GO TO 1), leaving a stale
# current element and no rays: EXPORT RAYPOS reported '0 rays at Element 1' on Dave's lens_array.in (12454 rays
# at model 128, the limit 441).  Now the trace runs, EXPORT finds the chief ray, and PARTIALS still refuses.
# The deck is pre-3.2 style (EltType=, fElt, eElt): its elements printed 'Default used for pData..lData' twenty
# times because the EltType= branch never set the grid-frame flags the Surface= branch sets (macos-fd 2026-10-19).
# MODEL: 128
# COPY: $ROOT/ZGD_test_files/lens_array.in
cd $TMP
old lens_array.in
build
1
export
tex
chfr
raypos
q
partials
